Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}What if a whale swallowed you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:06.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You float in the open ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:08.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A shadow rises from below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:11.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The mouth opens wider than a house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.45,0:00:13.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You slide in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.07,0:00:15.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:17.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:20.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Muscles crush you down the throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.14,0:00:21.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.68,0:00:23.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Acid rises.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:25.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your skin burns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.37,0:00:28.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.01,0:00:30.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Enzymes liquefy everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:32.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bones soften.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:33.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:35.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Nothing remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:37.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Not even teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But here's the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.03,0:00:42.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}No whale can swallow a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.76,0:00:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The throat is too narrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:48.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A blue whale's throat is only grapefruit-sized.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.37,0:00:52.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A sperm whale's throat fits barely a large fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:56.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The eighteen ninety-one James Bartley story was fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.36,0:01:00.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sperm whales dive two thousand meters deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.90,0:01:03.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}They hold their breath for ninety minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:05.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}So remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.90,0:01:07.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You are not on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.91,0:01:10.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Would you still swim with giants?
